{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14681","headline":"同辛兖州巢父卢副端岳相思献酬之作因抒归怀兼呈辛魏二院长杨长宁 · 戴叔伦","name":"同辛兖州巢父卢副端岳相思献酬之作因抒归怀兼呈辛魏二院长杨长宁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮角发高城，情人坐中起。\n临觞不及醉，分散秋风里。\n虽有明日期，离心若千里。\n前欢反惆怅，後会还如此。\n焉得夜淹留，一回终宴喜。\n羁游复牵役，皆去重湖水。\n早晚泛归舟，吾从数君子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14681.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14681","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}